# Nar Shaddaa's safe house and away (TSL, 303NAR, 301NAR, 003EBO): Zez-Kai
# Ell's questions asked through to "What happens now?" and the Jedi he
# left; urged to reconsider (DSimpson's light side), so he teaches a form
# and goes to Dantooine's Enclave; back aboard the Ebon Hawk, G0-T0's
# remote and Bao-Dur's first upgrade of G0-T0 (the Hawk's scenes of a
# boarding).
# Starts from the safe house's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @nar_shaddaa_zez data/routes/tsl/nar_shaddaa_zez.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Nar Shaddaa Finale" and "Post Nar Shaddaa Ebon
# Hawk" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
# Left: the companions' talks aboard, HK-47's rebuilding, Fassa's passage
# for Kahranna's family and Odis.
say What happens now?
say I urge you to reconsider.
to tr_zez351conv     # Zez-Kai Ell
talk
talk                 # the form taught (a_give_form): a_master_teach opens
                     # the safe house's secret door a_master_setup locked
talk                 # his farewell: the Enclave on Dantooine
say Could you help transport a family to Telos # Fassa, now the yacht is
say The mother's name is Kahranna # gone: passage for Kahranna's family,
say Do you have any need for pilots # and work for Odis the pilot (the
say The refugee Odis # Exchange +1)
use Fassa
talk
exit TO_301NAR       # out by that door and the flophouse to the landing pad
module 301nar
to to_ebonhawk
module 003ebo        # aboard: G0-T0's remote, then Bao-Dur's upgrade of him
talk
say [Repair] Install the droid's processor # HK-47 rebuilt: Kodin's
say [Repair] Reinforce the droid's damaged chassis # processor and the HK-50's
use DrdParts         # chassis fitted, the last part bringing him round
talk
save nar_shaddaa_done
